1
00:00:00,164 --> 00:00:01,264
(All characters and organisations in this drama are fictional.)

2
00:00:01,264 --> 00:00:02,364
(Filming with minors followed broadcast guidelines,)

3
00:00:02,364 --> 00:00:03,404
(and generative AI was used in select scenes.)

4
00:00:05,404 --> 00:00:07,404
(Episode 17)

5
00:00:12,314 --> 00:00:16,014
What? This isn't the way to our house.

6
00:00:20,454 --> 00:00:21,824
Where are we going?

7
00:00:22,824 --> 00:00:23,824
Gyeol.

8
00:00:26,254 --> 00:00:27,624
What if your mom and I...

9
00:00:29,064 --> 00:00:30,524
go somewhere nobody knows us...

10
00:00:31,394 --> 00:00:32,434
and the three of us live together?

11
00:01:05,264 --> 00:01:06,634
Do you know where we are?

12
00:01:14,804 --> 00:01:16,974
Really? Wow.

13
00:01:17,944 --> 00:01:20,174
My senior said he barely uses this house,

14
00:01:21,484 --> 00:01:23,644
so we can come visit whenever we want.

15
00:01:27,084 --> 00:01:28,284
But...

16
00:01:28,354 --> 00:01:30,184
I have never seen such a pretty house.

17
00:01:34,024 --> 00:01:35,124
Should I just buy this house for you?

18
00:01:36,894 --> 00:01:37,934
I'd better do it.

19
00:01:37,994 --> 00:01:40,294
I should tell him I'll sign the contract tomorrow.

20
00:01:41,194 --> 00:01:43,234
Gosh, I can't say anything around you.

21
00:01:43,304 --> 00:01:45,204
You want to buy me everything I mention.

22
00:01:45,974 --> 00:01:49,604
I will do whatever you like, and I will buy you anything.

23
00:01:50,204 --> 00:01:51,614
What else do you want?

24
00:01:52,114 --> 00:01:53,114
A star?

25
00:01:54,174 --> 00:01:55,384
Wait a little bit for a star.

26
00:01:57,384 --> 00:01:59,254
They are not on the market yet.

27
00:02:01,854 --> 00:02:03,924
Gosh, it's impossible to be with you.

28
00:02:05,224 --> 00:02:06,524
I should not say anything anymore.

29
00:02:08,224 --> 00:02:09,824
What should I do?

30
00:02:11,464 --> 00:02:13,394
How can you be so lovely?

31
00:02:15,034 --> 00:02:18,274
I want to hide you away and keep you all to myself.

32
00:02:20,674 --> 00:02:22,874
But what did you get on your face?

33
00:02:24,074 --> 00:02:26,014
You have a lot on your face too, Mu Jin.

34
00:02:26,144 --> 00:02:28,114
- Do I have some too? - Come here.

35
00:02:34,654 --> 00:02:35,654
It is good, right?

36
00:02:51,434 --> 00:02:54,804
I bought this house from my senior.

37
00:03:02,914 --> 00:03:05,914
When Gyeol wakes up, he'll be like, "Where am I?"

38
00:03:05,984 --> 00:03:07,014
He will be so surprised.

39
00:03:09,324 --> 00:03:10,524
You are hungry, right?

40
00:03:11,524 --> 00:03:12,654
No, I'm fine.

41
00:03:13,254 --> 00:03:15,494
I will check what is in the refrigerator first.

42
00:03:21,094 --> 00:03:22,534
Thank you for coming with me.

43
00:03:27,304 --> 00:03:28,544
If you had said no,

44
00:03:29,944 --> 00:03:31,544
I would have cried out of embarrassment.

45
00:04:04,604 --> 00:04:07,544
Is pork belly okay? I opened the refrigerator,

46
00:04:07,614 --> 00:04:09,114
and there was aged kimchi and pork belly.

47
00:04:10,214 --> 00:04:11,314
Give it to me. I'll do it.

48
00:04:12,454 --> 00:04:14,184
Don't lift a finger and just stay still.

49
00:04:17,354 --> 00:04:19,194
Oh, should I wake Gyeol up to eat?

50
00:04:20,354 --> 00:04:23,264
I want to let him sleep. He must be very tired.

51
00:04:24,524 --> 00:04:25,964
Right, that would be better.

52
00:04:27,664 --> 00:04:29,704
We can just make him food later when he wakes up.

53
00:04:42,444 --> 00:04:43,584
But this house...

54
00:04:44,644 --> 00:04:46,254
hasn't changed at all.

55
00:04:46,314 --> 00:04:48,424
I left everything exactly as it was...

56
00:04:51,084 --> 00:04:53,624
so that we could come together when you returned someday.

57
00:04:54,864 --> 00:04:57,594
That's why I left everything exactly as it was.

58
00:05:17,384 --> 00:05:18,414
- Gyu Seo. - What?

59
00:05:18,414 --> 00:05:20,184
Gyu Rim is not home yet.

60
00:05:20,684 --> 00:05:21,884
It's past 11pm.

61
00:05:23,054 --> 00:05:24,384
She went on a trip with Gyeol.

62
00:05:24,684 --> 00:05:26,894
She sent a message earlier, telling us to sleep and not worry.

63
00:05:26,954 --> 00:05:29,724
- Sorry I didn't share it. - She went on a trip with Gyeol?

64
00:05:29,794 --> 00:05:31,224
Suddenly? Where?

65
00:05:32,094 --> 00:05:33,234
I don't know that.

66
00:05:35,064 --> 00:05:36,834
She probably went with Mu Jin.

67
00:05:38,704 --> 00:05:40,304
She went with Mu Jin?

68
00:05:41,074 --> 00:05:44,474
Is Gyu Rim seeing Mu Jin again? Did they decide to date again?

69
00:05:44,604 --> 00:05:47,644
Were you not strongly against Gyu Rim and Mu Jin?

70
00:05:48,184 --> 00:05:50,384
That was because I was worried she would have a hard time.

71
00:05:50,644 --> 00:05:53,214
I liked Mu Jin from the beginning.

72
00:05:53,354 --> 00:05:56,484
Gosh, trying not to show it was so hard for me.

73
00:05:56,554 --> 00:05:59,494
Right? Oh, if you kept opposing Mu Jin,

74
00:05:59,554 --> 00:06:02,194
I was going to take you and enter a monastery or something.

75
00:06:02,724 --> 00:06:06,494
Han Gyu Rim, come out. Come out right now, Han Gyu Rim.

76
00:06:07,294 --> 00:06:08,634
Has she still not left?

77
00:06:09,034 --> 00:06:11,164
Come out right now, Han Gyu Rim.

78
00:06:12,774 --> 00:06:13,774
Darn it...

79
00:06:15,774 --> 00:06:17,744
Darn it... She is only one year older than me,

80
00:06:17,804 --> 00:06:19,444
so who is she to act like the older sister?

81
00:06:19,514 --> 00:06:21,684
Who is she to point fingers at me?

82
00:06:22,014 --> 00:06:24,244
She can't even take care of herself.

83
00:06:24,444 --> 00:06:26,654
She does not even know how blood type combinations work,

84
00:06:26,714 --> 00:06:29,584
so how dare she give me advice?

85
00:06:30,054 --> 00:06:32,794
She is so stupid, idiotic, and ignorant.

86
00:06:33,554 --> 00:06:35,394
Are you not coming out right now, Han Gyu Rim?

87
00:06:38,634 --> 00:06:40,964
Hey, Han Gyu Oh, you come out too.

88
00:06:41,494 --> 00:06:45,104
This jerk. He treats his sister like total garbage. Darn it...

89
00:06:45,174 --> 00:06:47,234
He only graduated middle school, yet he dares to mess with...

90
00:06:47,304 --> 00:06:49,374
his older sister who even studied abroad?

91
00:06:49,444 --> 00:06:51,974
You can't even spell Christmas.

92
00:06:52,314 --> 00:06:56,284
Come out right now. Let's fight, you jerk!

93
00:06:58,484 --> 00:07:01,414
Darn it, these guys seriously.

94
00:07:01,654 --> 00:07:03,684
Hey, are you scared?

95
00:07:04,884 --> 00:07:08,224
Where did they all learn to act like this? Those idiots.

96
00:07:08,864 --> 00:07:11,364
Who taught you to act like this...

97
00:07:13,094 --> 00:07:15,664
Oh...

98
00:07:15,734 --> 00:07:17,834
Right.

99
00:07:17,904 --> 00:07:19,274
Do red beans grow where soybeans are planted,

100
00:07:19,334 --> 00:07:21,074
and does rice grow where barley is planted?

101
00:07:23,374 --> 00:07:25,444
Hey!

102
00:07:28,144 --> 00:07:31,284
The one who completely ruined raising his kids.

103
00:07:31,344 --> 00:07:33,084
The one who is an embarrassment wherever he goes,

104
00:07:33,154 --> 00:07:36,124
Mr. Han Seok Joong.

105
00:07:39,594 --> 00:07:41,894
I had to eat and drink...

106
00:07:41,894 --> 00:07:45,794
all that food and expensive alcohol because nobody showed up!

107
00:07:50,204 --> 00:07:52,634
I said it was the last time,

108
00:07:52,704 --> 00:07:55,074
and that we would never see each other again.

109
00:07:57,174 --> 00:07:59,414
For a man who goes crazy for Nanjawanseu,

110
00:07:59,414 --> 00:08:02,014
why on earth did you not show up?

111
00:08:02,814 --> 00:08:06,184
What kind of father is this petty?

112
00:08:06,454 --> 00:08:09,524
What kind of father acts like this?

113
00:08:22,664 --> 00:08:24,034
Hey.

114
00:08:24,104 --> 00:08:25,104
Hey!

115
00:08:25,174 --> 00:08:29,904
Open the door. Let's have a little talk!

116
00:08:29,974 --> 00:08:32,614
Just wash your feet and go to sleep.

117
00:08:39,514 --> 00:08:42,554
Stop drunken rambling, and before someone reports you for the noise,

118
00:08:42,624 --> 00:08:45,494
go inside quietly and get some sleep.

119
00:08:45,554 --> 00:08:47,424
What is this now?

120
00:08:47,854 --> 00:08:49,694
I'm not a "this," I'm Han Gyu Min.

121
00:08:50,064 --> 00:08:53,034
Is that so? Han Gyu Min. You are dead meat.

122
00:08:53,794 --> 00:08:56,204
How dare a punk like you ignore my texts?

123
00:08:56,464 --> 00:09:00,604
I treated you like humans and asked to have a meal together,

124
00:09:00,934 --> 00:09:02,644
and you dare to ignore my texts?

125
00:09:02,744 --> 00:09:05,344
If we had gone, you would have thrown a fit about us showing up.

126
00:09:05,814 --> 00:09:07,544
And what? Treated like humans?

127
00:09:07,814 --> 00:09:09,244
Are Gyu Seo and I insects then?

128
00:09:09,314 --> 00:09:10,684
Are we sea anemones or something?

129
00:09:11,184 --> 00:09:13,954
How dare you talk back to your older sister like that?

130
00:09:14,014 --> 00:09:16,254
What kind of older sister are you?

131
00:09:16,524 --> 00:09:18,494
When have you ever treated Gyu Seo and me like your siblings?

132
00:09:18,924 --> 00:09:22,694
- To you, we are total Untouchables. - Hey!

133
00:09:23,124 --> 00:09:24,924
You are so ignorant.

134
00:09:24,994 --> 00:09:29,064
It is not Untouchables. It is the Untouchables.

135
00:09:29,134 --> 00:09:30,764
Oh, how embarrassing.

136
00:09:31,034 --> 00:09:33,174
Don't ever tell anyone anywhere that you know me.

137
00:09:33,234 --> 00:09:37,204
- I ought to just. - Yes, I won't. I absolutely won't.

138
00:09:37,274 --> 00:09:38,274
When friends ask,

139
00:09:38,274 --> 00:09:40,114
I always say we were a two-son, two-daughter family anyway.

140
00:09:40,174 --> 00:09:41,644
"Two-son, two-daughter family..."

141
00:09:43,684 --> 00:09:44,684
Here.

142
00:09:45,854 --> 00:09:48,384
- What is this? - It is a wedding gift for you.

143
00:09:48,654 --> 00:09:51,184
- What? - Where did you get money for that?

144
00:09:51,724 --> 00:09:52,954
I'm sorry it's not much.

145
00:09:53,654 --> 00:09:54,824
Congratulations on your wedding.

146
00:09:55,894 --> 00:09:57,024
Hey.

147
00:09:58,864 --> 00:10:00,764
What? 500 dollars?

148
00:10:00,834 --> 00:10:02,864
Why would you give 500 dollars for a wedding gift?

149
00:10:02,934 --> 00:10:04,264
Where does a student get that kind of money?

150
00:10:07,204 --> 00:10:08,404
Here.

151
00:10:09,144 --> 00:10:11,814
What? You want me to buy gum with this?

152
00:10:12,544 --> 00:10:15,384
What do you guys take me for?

153
00:10:19,054 --> 00:10:21,684
- Hey! - I don't need your pocket money.

154
00:10:22,024 --> 00:10:23,854
Pick it up, right now.

155
00:10:23,924 --> 00:10:26,194
Han Gyu Seo worked so hard at his part-time job to earn this.

156
00:10:26,254 --> 00:10:30,394
I said I don't need that kind of money, so move.

157
00:10:30,464 --> 00:10:32,094
Just move, Han Gyu Min.

158
00:10:32,164 --> 00:10:35,734
You worthless beggars.

159
00:10:35,804 --> 00:10:36,804
What?

160
00:10:38,034 --> 00:10:39,034
Beggars?

161
00:10:43,144 --> 00:10:44,744
Darn it!

162
00:10:46,074 --> 00:10:49,984
Hey. Are you a dog? Why would you bite someone?

163
00:10:51,314 --> 00:10:52,854
If you want to hit, hit me.

164
00:10:52,914 --> 00:10:56,684
- Hey! - Don't touch Han Gyu Seo.

165
00:10:57,584 --> 00:10:59,094
If you want to hit someone, hit me.

166
00:10:59,154 --> 00:11:02,964
- Until you feel better. - What are you guys doing right now?

167
00:11:03,424 --> 00:11:06,494
Right. I was hoping to catch just one of you today,

168
00:11:06,564 --> 00:11:07,894
and you're the lucky winner.

169
00:11:07,964 --> 00:11:10,764
Why are you hitting the kids again?

170
00:11:11,134 --> 00:11:12,134
- Darn it... - Just hit...

171
00:11:12,974 --> 00:11:15,974
me instead. Hit me. I'm the root of all this,

172
00:11:16,044 --> 00:11:17,404
so beat me up.

173
00:11:17,404 --> 00:11:20,014
What is this childish situation now?

174
00:11:20,074 --> 00:11:22,944
What, are you teaming up three-on-one to fight me?

175
00:11:23,284 --> 00:11:26,314
What did the twins even do? Why are you picking on them?

176
00:11:26,384 --> 00:11:28,414
Are they just a joke to you?

177
00:11:28,484 --> 00:11:31,524
They keep teaming up and making me angry.

178
00:11:31,684 --> 00:11:33,954
They're my kids, not yours. Okay?

179
00:11:33,954 --> 00:11:36,524
Who are you to keep messing with my kids?

180
00:11:40,564 --> 00:11:41,864
Oh, I don't feel so good.

181
00:11:42,604 --> 00:11:43,964
- I'm going to throw up. - Oh, gross.

182
00:11:44,034 --> 00:11:45,274
What is it?

183
00:11:45,334 --> 00:11:48,304
I was already feeling nauseous from the Chinese food.

184
00:11:48,744 --> 00:11:50,874
I have a really high tolerance for alcohol.

185
00:11:51,074 --> 00:11:53,014
My stomach is completely upside down right now.

186
00:11:53,544 --> 00:11:54,914
- Hey! - Hey!

187
00:11:54,914 --> 00:11:56,884
Gosh, no...

188
00:11:56,944 --> 00:11:59,714
Hey, is there a bowl? Bring a bowl.

189
00:11:59,784 --> 00:12:02,084
Stay still. Hey, hold it in. Just hold it in a little longer.

190
00:12:02,154 --> 00:12:03,454
Hold it in. Hey, hurry up and bring it.

191
00:12:03,524 --> 00:12:06,024
Just hold it in a little longer. Hold it in. Stay still.

192
00:12:06,094 --> 00:12:08,154
Hey. Bring a bowl. Oh, hey...

193
00:12:08,224 --> 00:12:09,264
Oh, Dad...

194
00:12:10,124 --> 00:12:11,364
- Oh, man. - Oh, darn it.

195
00:13:23,504 --> 00:13:25,234
It doesn't look like Gyeol is going to wake up anytime soon, right?

196
00:13:27,234 --> 00:13:29,404
Gyeol's fingernails and toenails.

197
00:13:29,474 --> 00:13:31,274
You clipped them really nicely.

198
00:13:32,944 --> 00:13:35,274
I was so nervous I was going to hurt Gyeol.

199
00:13:36,114 --> 00:13:37,814
How do you do something so scary every time?

200
00:13:38,914 --> 00:13:40,154
You just do it when you become a mother.

201
00:13:41,084 --> 00:13:42,854
I was so nervous at first, too.

202
00:13:46,194 --> 00:13:47,554
Do you want a cup of tea?

203
00:13:47,624 --> 00:13:49,164
I have some really good chamomile tea.

204
00:14:07,974 --> 00:14:08,984
It's delicious.

205
00:14:13,954 --> 00:14:15,984
Do you still walk around with your shoelaces untied?

206
00:14:16,684 --> 00:14:17,854
They came untied again.

207
00:14:20,994 --> 00:14:23,564
I've never seen anyone as busy as you in my entire life.

208
00:14:24,164 --> 00:14:26,234
So busy that you don't even have time to tie your shoelaces.

209
00:14:31,104 --> 00:14:34,504
I'll keep tying your shoelaces for you from now on.

210
00:14:37,844 --> 00:14:39,574
I'm too worried that you might trip and fall.

211
00:14:44,114 --> 00:14:45,954
I think I need to stay by your side.

212
00:14:48,414 --> 00:14:49,724
Even if I get struck by lightning,

213
00:14:50,524 --> 00:14:52,394
I need to be by your side,

214
00:14:52,454 --> 00:14:53,494
and by Gyeol's side...

215
00:14:56,064 --> 00:14:57,294
from now on.

216
00:15:31,924 --> 00:15:34,494
What is this? Where did you get beaten up like this?

217
00:15:35,934 --> 00:15:37,104
Gosh...

218
00:15:37,164 --> 00:15:38,904
Seriously, what happened to your face?

219
00:15:38,974 --> 00:15:41,674
- Did you get hit by some lady? - Hey, keep it down, man.

220
00:15:42,104 --> 00:15:43,374
Who was it?

221
00:15:43,444 --> 00:15:46,044
Who turned you into such an ugly panda?

222
00:15:46,974 --> 00:15:48,674
Do you want the whole family to know?

223
00:15:49,214 --> 00:15:50,544
I told you to keep it down, you punk.

224
00:15:56,624 --> 00:15:58,354
Darn it.

225
00:15:58,424 --> 00:16:00,094
You really got beaten up all over.

226
00:16:04,964 --> 00:16:06,334
I'm fine.

227
00:16:06,394 --> 00:16:08,064
You will know once you start working in the real world,

228
00:16:08,394 --> 00:16:10,834
but you beat someone up sometimes, and you get beaten up sometimes.

229
00:16:11,034 --> 00:16:12,064
Are you a gangster?

230
00:16:12,374 --> 00:16:13,904
Did you expand into the gangster business or something?

231
00:16:14,734 --> 00:16:15,944
I said keep it down.

232
00:16:16,644 --> 00:16:18,244
We are in big trouble if Gyu Rim finds out.

233
00:16:18,504 --> 00:16:19,774
Gyu Rim is not here.

234
00:16:20,274 --> 00:16:21,344
She went on a trip with Gyeol.

235
00:16:21,714 --> 00:16:22,714
She is not here?

236
00:16:23,584 --> 00:16:24,784
Oh, what a relief.

237
00:16:25,444 --> 00:16:27,914
I should have just slept outside instead of coming home.

238
00:16:28,484 --> 00:16:30,154
Why would you sleep three days outside when you have a home?

239
00:16:30,854 --> 00:16:32,324
What did you do so well to sleep outside for three days?

240
00:16:33,054 --> 00:16:34,124
You are really going at me today.

241
00:16:40,164 --> 00:16:43,764
I wiped up Han Gyu Young's vomit one more time this morning,

242
00:16:43,834 --> 00:16:45,064
but you should wipe it again.

243
00:16:45,464 --> 00:16:47,274
I don't know how much she mixed her drinks.

244
00:16:47,804 --> 00:16:49,574
Gosh, the smell.

245
00:16:49,644 --> 00:16:50,644
Got it.

246
00:16:56,314 --> 00:16:57,444
Did Han Gyu Young throw up?

247
00:16:59,054 --> 00:17:01,484
- Yes. - She is a total heavyweight.

248
00:17:02,224 --> 00:17:05,354
She has an iron stomach, so she rarely throws up.

249
00:17:10,364 --> 00:17:11,824
Right.

250
00:17:11,894 --> 00:17:14,034
This is the best you can do. What are you going to do about it?

251
00:17:14,564 --> 00:17:16,904
Are you going to kill me or save me?

252
00:17:22,204 --> 00:17:25,504
I'm telling you, you can't be fixed.

253
00:17:25,814 --> 00:17:29,044
Just live the way you were made.

254
00:17:34,114 --> 00:17:35,154
Hey.

255
00:17:35,824 --> 00:17:37,024
Hey.

256
00:17:37,324 --> 00:17:39,024
You are hopeless.

257
00:17:39,424 --> 00:17:41,254
Absolutely hopeless.

258
00:17:41,554 --> 00:17:42,564
Han Gyu Young!

259
00:17:45,894 --> 00:17:48,964
Darn it. Oh, you startled me, you jerk.

260
00:17:49,034 --> 00:17:50,804
I thought a complaining patient came to kill me.

261
00:17:52,534 --> 00:17:54,934
What? What is wrong with your eyes?

262
00:17:56,244 --> 00:17:57,244
Let us go get some hangover food.

263
00:17:57,304 --> 00:17:59,244
I'm not going, you jerk. Are you trying to make up for it now?

264
00:18:04,244 --> 00:18:06,554
Darn it. Hey!

265
00:18:09,124 --> 00:18:10,554
Oh, I can finally live.

266
00:18:10,624 --> 00:18:12,794
Cold noodles are definitely the best hangover cure.

267
00:18:14,454 --> 00:18:17,494
So you drank all that strong liquor by yourself?

268
00:18:18,494 --> 00:18:20,034
What else could I do when no one showed up?

269
00:18:23,104 --> 00:18:25,704
Do you know what Dad said...

270
00:18:25,704 --> 00:18:27,274
when he and the twins ganged up on me?

271
00:18:28,304 --> 00:18:30,044
He said, "Are they my kids or your kids?"

272
00:18:30,104 --> 00:18:31,544
"Who are you to mess with my kids?"

273
00:18:32,744 --> 00:18:35,014
Are they saying I'm not his kid or what?

274
00:18:35,074 --> 00:18:36,614
It is so unfair and frustrating, seriously.

275
00:18:37,314 --> 00:18:39,414
Fine, let the three of them be on the same side.

276
00:18:39,484 --> 00:18:40,954
Han Gyu Rim, you, and I will be on a side.

277
00:18:41,154 --> 00:18:43,324
Oh, Han Gyu Rim is on their side.

278
00:18:43,384 --> 00:18:45,254
The two of us will team up.

279
00:18:46,724 --> 00:18:48,024
What is up with Dad?

280
00:18:48,354 --> 00:18:49,964
He actually said something right for once.

281
00:18:50,524 --> 00:18:52,494
Exactly, why did you mess with Dad's kids?

282
00:18:52,834 --> 00:18:53,964
Who do you think you are?

283
00:18:54,694 --> 00:18:57,764
- What did you say, you jerk? - Instead of badmouthing the family,

284
00:18:57,834 --> 00:18:59,834
have you not reflected on what your own problem is?

285
00:19:00,674 --> 00:19:02,804
You told people our perfectly alive father was dead,

286
00:19:03,104 --> 00:19:05,914
and cut off Gyu Rim and me for not meeting your standards.

287
00:19:06,144 --> 00:19:08,314
You don't treat Gyu Seo and Gyu Min like humans, let alone siblings,

288
00:19:08,374 --> 00:19:09,714
so who would go there?

289
00:19:10,414 --> 00:19:11,784
Coming when you call and leaving when you tell us to.

290
00:19:11,844 --> 00:19:13,354
Do you think we are your spineless lapdogs?

291
00:19:16,024 --> 00:19:17,024
People are staring.

292
00:19:17,084 --> 00:19:18,554
Shut your mouth and just eat your cold noodles, darn it.

293
00:19:18,624 --> 00:19:20,524
How can I eat cold noodles with my mouth shut?

294
00:19:23,494 --> 00:19:24,624
You eat as much as you want,

295
00:19:24,694 --> 00:19:26,894
and if you are going to leave, get out of our house immediately.

296
00:19:35,504 --> 00:19:36,904
Han Gyu Oh, seriously, even you.

297
00:19:39,744 --> 00:19:41,714
Fine, once I leave,

298
00:19:41,774 --> 00:19:43,784
I will never look in the direction of this wretched house again.

299
00:19:47,854 --> 00:19:49,124
Ma'am, one bottle of soju here...

300
00:19:50,154 --> 00:19:51,354
Oh, I have to go to work.

301
00:19:52,594 --> 00:19:53,754
We need more cold noodle broth here.

302
00:19:53,824 --> 00:19:55,694
Put a lot of ice in it so it is freezing cold.

303
00:20:05,904 --> 00:20:06,904
Gosh.

304
00:20:10,644 --> 00:20:12,204
Don't eat ramyeon.

305
00:20:12,274 --> 00:20:15,314
Have kimchi stew and rice with us.

306
00:20:15,374 --> 00:20:18,744
No, it is okay. I have no appetite, so I will just have some ramyeon.

307
00:20:18,844 --> 00:20:21,554
I'm going to make the kimchi stew with tuna.

308
00:20:21,614 --> 00:20:24,484
I will put in two cans with huge chunks.

309
00:20:24,824 --> 00:20:28,154
- You put in two cans of tuna? - Yes. I will make tuna pancakes.

310
00:20:28,354 --> 00:20:29,624
Coated nicely in egg.

311
00:20:31,294 --> 00:20:35,234
Hey, if you make an offer I can't refuse like that, I'm sold.

312
00:20:36,764 --> 00:20:39,934
You know, making a salad with tuna is really delicious, too.

313
00:20:40,404 --> 00:20:42,404
Tuna gimbap is also incredibly good.

314
00:20:42,474 --> 00:20:45,304
I think tuna tastes great no matter what you put it in.

315
00:20:47,474 --> 00:20:48,944
- Dad. - Yes?

316
00:20:50,684 --> 00:20:53,784
Thanks for taking my side against Han Gyu Young yesterday.

317
00:20:55,314 --> 00:20:56,354
Oh, that?

318
00:20:57,624 --> 00:20:59,154
It was the obvious thing to do.

319
00:20:59,424 --> 00:21:01,724
Hey, you are my kid, not someone else's.

320
00:21:02,694 --> 00:21:04,964
My paternal love is no joke.

321
00:21:06,294 --> 00:21:08,334
Go wait inside. I will call you when it is ready.

322
00:21:08,464 --> 00:21:11,764
By the way, did Gyu Rim go on a trip with just Gyeol?

323
00:21:11,934 --> 00:21:15,234
Man, she should have invited me. I really love travelling.

324
00:21:17,474 --> 00:21:18,474
Go inside.

325
00:21:19,514 --> 00:21:21,374
- Go. - I opened the ramyeon package...

326
00:21:21,444 --> 00:21:22,514
I will seal it up.

327
00:22:39,624 --> 00:22:40,854
Mister.

328
00:22:41,754 --> 00:22:43,864
Are you awake? You must be hungry, right?

329
00:22:47,264 --> 00:22:48,964
Where are we?

330
00:22:49,404 --> 00:22:51,834
Here? It is my house.

331
00:22:52,234 --> 00:22:55,034
The house I prepared because I wanted to bring you here, Gyeol.

332
00:22:59,644 --> 00:23:00,714
Is your mom still sleeping?

333
00:23:01,144 --> 00:23:02,144
Yes.

334
00:23:02,744 --> 00:23:04,484
She must have been really tired.

335
00:23:04,544 --> 00:23:07,184
Yes. After you came to my house,

336
00:23:07,254 --> 00:23:09,484
your mom probably could not sleep peacefully for even one hour.

337
00:23:10,854 --> 00:23:12,454
Let's not wake her up until she gets up on her own.

338
00:23:13,394 --> 00:23:14,394
Okay.

339
00:23:16,364 --> 00:23:17,494
I'm sorry for just bringing you here...

340
00:23:17,564 --> 00:23:19,094
without even asking for your opinion.

341
00:23:19,394 --> 00:23:21,964
I really, really, super, super like it.

342
00:23:23,334 --> 00:23:26,604
- Your mom will call your teacher. - Okay.

343
00:23:29,204 --> 00:23:30,474
But...

344
00:23:31,674 --> 00:23:33,144
what about you?

345
00:23:33,814 --> 00:23:34,814
Why?

346
00:23:35,344 --> 00:23:37,314
If you keep skipping work like this every day,

347
00:23:37,844 --> 00:23:40,614
won't Jung Woo kick you out?

348
00:23:42,314 --> 00:23:44,324
Good point. What should I do?

349
00:23:45,654 --> 00:23:48,524
Well, I will have to beg. Very earnestly.

350
00:23:50,494 --> 00:23:52,064
- By the way. - Yes.

351
00:23:53,294 --> 00:23:55,034
Do you smell something burning?

352
00:24:02,874 --> 00:24:04,074
Darn it.

353
00:24:30,834 --> 00:24:32,874
Have I been sleeping this whole time?

354
00:24:36,874 --> 00:24:38,674
Gyeol.

355
00:24:38,744 --> 00:24:39,944
Han Gyeol.

356
00:25:02,234 --> 00:25:04,964
I was going to send a message, but I thought it might wake you up.

357
00:25:05,234 --> 00:25:07,134
I made rice in the rice cooker,

358
00:25:07,334 --> 00:25:09,004
so just heat up the soybean paste stew.

359
00:25:09,274 --> 00:25:12,004
I fed Gyeol a big meal, so don't worry.

360
00:25:16,644 --> 00:25:18,044
It is from a novel...

361
00:25:18,114 --> 00:25:20,484
I read a very long time ago that I can't even remember the title of,

362
00:25:21,384 --> 00:25:24,454
but the male lead says this to the female lead.

363
00:25:26,254 --> 00:25:28,594
That he wants to take half of the time he has left...

364
00:25:28,654 --> 00:25:30,424
and give it to her so she can sleep.

365
00:25:32,364 --> 00:25:34,894
The female lead was always so busy with work...

366
00:25:34,964 --> 00:25:36,764
that she never got enough sleep.

367
00:25:46,644 --> 00:25:48,074
There are a lot here.

368
00:25:51,814 --> 00:25:53,554
- Let me see, look. - There really are a lot.

369
00:25:54,854 --> 00:25:55,854
Awesome.

370
00:25:58,954 --> 00:26:00,354
Oh, there are so many!

371
00:26:00,754 --> 00:26:01,854
Put them in.

372
00:26:02,894 --> 00:26:03,964
High five.

373
00:26:05,164 --> 00:26:06,934
That is how I felt, too.

374
00:26:07,734 --> 00:26:09,504
I wanted to let you sleep.

375
00:26:10,804 --> 00:26:14,104
You are so exhausted and tired from working yourself to the bone.

376
00:26:14,374 --> 00:26:16,174
I wanted to let you sleep as much as you want.

377
00:26:18,374 --> 00:26:19,744
Hey, Mom!

378
00:26:26,484 --> 00:26:29,314
Even if it meant giving you all the time I have left.

379
00:26:51,444 --> 00:26:53,674
What sin did I commit in my past life?

380
00:26:54,644 --> 00:26:56,114
What could I have possibly done...

381
00:26:56,184 --> 00:26:58,544
to get tangled up with a guy like Kim Mu Jin?

382
00:27:00,454 --> 00:27:02,454
Being business partners was not enough,

383
00:27:02,514 --> 00:27:04,354
so now we are roommates, too.

384
00:27:07,294 --> 00:27:10,024
This awkwardness. This guilt.

385
00:27:10,494 --> 00:27:12,164
Why is all this discomfort...

386
00:27:12,864 --> 00:27:14,394
mine to bear?

387
00:27:15,734 --> 00:27:17,134
I asked where Mu Jin went,

388
00:27:17,204 --> 00:27:18,604
so why do you keep changing the subject?

389
00:27:19,974 --> 00:27:22,774
- I told you I don't know. - Why is his phone turned off?

390
00:27:22,844 --> 00:27:24,344
Did I turn his phone off?

391
00:27:24,974 --> 00:27:27,574
The battery probably died, or it is broken.

392
00:27:45,124 --> 00:27:46,894
You said you were going to let Mu Jin go.

393
00:27:47,494 --> 00:27:48,564
If you decided to let him go,

394
00:27:48,634 --> 00:27:50,504
then just make a clean break, please.

395
00:27:50,564 --> 00:27:51,934
Don't be pathetic about it.

396
00:27:54,574 --> 00:27:58,004
Kim Mu Jin is not my dad's son.

397
00:27:59,044 --> 00:28:00,414
My dad lied.

398
00:28:00,814 --> 00:28:03,314
To protect my mom, his own wife.

399
00:28:06,814 --> 00:28:08,154
You found out, too.

400
00:28:09,524 --> 00:28:10,524
I mean,

401
00:28:10,584 --> 00:28:12,784
Gyu Rim being Yoon Hee's biological daughter...

402
00:28:12,854 --> 00:28:14,394
makes a lot more sense.

403
00:28:15,024 --> 00:28:16,624
You knew about this, too?

404
00:28:19,364 --> 00:28:20,894
What did I just say?

405
00:28:21,434 --> 00:28:22,764
Does Mu Jin know, too?

406
00:28:24,964 --> 00:28:26,604
I, well...

407
00:28:26,674 --> 00:28:28,374
My stomach hurts, so I need to use the restroom.

408
00:28:30,204 --> 00:28:32,344
Did you and Mu Jin know all this time...

409
00:28:32,404 --> 00:28:35,144
- and made me look like an idiot? - Seo Hyun.

410
00:28:35,214 --> 00:28:36,714
I only found out yesterday, too.

411
00:28:38,114 --> 00:28:40,384
Just accept it and give up, please.

412
00:28:40,914 --> 00:28:44,254
Either way, you and Mu Jin are not going to work out.

413
00:29:04,304 --> 00:29:05,744
Code red emergency.

414
00:29:05,804 --> 00:29:08,514
Seo Hyun knows about Yoon Hee and Gyu Rim.

415
00:29:08,514 --> 00:29:10,784
She has completely lost it,

416
00:29:10,844 --> 00:29:12,914
and it is out of control. Don't come to Seoul.

417
00:29:12,984 --> 00:29:15,154
Just lay low right where you are for a while.

418
00:29:15,214 --> 00:29:17,484
No. Just emigrate to another country.

419
00:29:17,924 --> 00:29:20,254
No. Just leave the planet.

420
00:29:28,394 --> 00:29:29,964
There you go.

421
00:29:31,164 --> 00:29:33,934
- Do you like it that much? - Yes, I love it.

422
00:29:34,004 --> 00:29:37,074
It is so much fun. I'm so happy.

423
00:29:40,644 --> 00:29:43,684
But I'm so tired.

424
00:29:44,044 --> 00:29:47,054
Until Mu Jin's soup is ready, can I sleep for a bit?

425
00:29:47,784 --> 00:29:49,584
Of course you can.

426
00:30:03,004 --> 00:30:05,034
- Where is Gyeol? - He must have been really tired.

427
00:30:05,434 --> 00:30:07,374
He said he wants to sleep a bit until the soup is ready.

428
00:30:08,774 --> 00:30:10,744
I'll do it. You should rest too, Mu Jin.

429
00:30:10,744 --> 00:30:12,004
Don't worry.

430
00:30:12,674 --> 00:30:14,714
I told you not to lift a finger, right?

431
00:30:14,774 --> 00:30:16,044
Don't do anything.

432
00:30:18,384 --> 00:30:20,384
Should I make you some coffee? Do you want some coffee?

433
00:30:22,554 --> 00:30:24,084
Let me move around a bit.

434
00:30:24,484 --> 00:30:26,184
I'm going to turn into stone at this rate.

435
00:30:28,024 --> 00:30:29,624
I will go make the coffee then.

436
00:30:34,164 --> 00:30:35,664
Let me ask you for a favour, Gyu Rim.

437
00:30:49,744 --> 00:30:53,484
A lot of things are going to shake you up from now on.

438
00:30:55,884 --> 00:30:57,284
But don't let them shake you.

439
00:31:06,834 --> 00:31:08,234
Don't look at anything,

440
00:31:09,164 --> 00:31:10,564
and don't listen to anything.

441
00:31:12,904 --> 00:31:15,504
Only look at me, and only listen to me.

442
00:31:18,104 --> 00:31:19,374
Can you do that for me?

443
00:31:53,674 --> 00:31:54,944
What are you doing right now?

444
00:31:57,014 --> 00:31:58,514
Why are you packing your bags?

445
00:32:00,284 --> 00:32:01,284
Honey.

446
00:32:06,254 --> 00:32:08,694
Are you really going to leave just because Seo Hyun told you to?

447
00:32:08,954 --> 00:32:10,594
Were you always this irresponsible?

448
00:32:12,794 --> 00:32:14,234
I just need to disappear.

449
00:32:15,664 --> 00:32:17,764
Everything will be resolved if I just disappear.

450
00:32:18,004 --> 00:32:20,034
What exactly gets resolved if you disappear?

451
00:32:21,374 --> 00:32:22,374
Honey.

452
00:32:23,704 --> 00:32:26,574
When you decided to confess to Seo Hyun,

453
00:32:26,644 --> 00:32:28,944
did you not think she would throw a fit like this?

454
00:32:29,314 --> 00:32:32,214
She is already half out of her mind, so did you not prepare yourself...

455
00:32:32,284 --> 00:32:34,954
for whatever might come out of her mouth?

456
00:32:36,954 --> 00:32:38,284
I did think about it.

457
00:32:39,224 --> 00:32:40,694
I was prepared.

458
00:32:41,254 --> 00:32:42,824
No matter how much Seo Hyun criticized me,

459
00:32:42,894 --> 00:32:45,124
I told myself to swallow it, hold it in, and endure it.

460
00:32:46,564 --> 00:32:48,534
I told myself to be thick-skinned and shameless.

461
00:32:48,864 --> 00:32:50,704
I tried so hard to make up my mind...

462
00:32:52,734 --> 00:32:53,974
But I can't do it.

463
00:32:54,874 --> 00:32:57,344
I can't bear to see Seo Hyun suffering because of me.

464
00:32:58,904 --> 00:33:01,944
I can't stand seeing Seo Hyun get hurt...

465
00:33:03,344 --> 00:33:05,944
and heartbroken because of me anymore.

466
00:33:06,014 --> 00:33:07,554
How is this your fault?

467
00:33:08,414 --> 00:33:09,924
What did you even do?

468
00:33:10,884 --> 00:33:12,324
How did you raise Seo Hyun?

469
00:33:13,324 --> 00:33:15,694
You treated her like she was made of glass.

470
00:33:16,454 --> 00:33:19,664
You raised Seo Hyun with such constant worry, right?

471
00:33:20,494 --> 00:33:23,434
And you even cut ties with your own biological children.

472
00:33:24,134 --> 00:33:26,334
You lived like that all for Seo Hyun.

473
00:33:27,204 --> 00:33:28,504
I know that.

474
00:33:33,044 --> 00:33:36,374
I heard you are going to be my mom from now on.

475
00:33:37,044 --> 00:33:38,214
Yes, Seo Hyun.

476
00:33:39,314 --> 00:33:40,554
I hope we get along.

477
00:33:44,284 --> 00:33:46,824
I heard you also have a daughter my age.

478
00:33:48,994 --> 00:33:49,994
Yes.

479
00:33:51,264 --> 00:33:52,264
I do.

480
00:33:52,764 --> 00:33:54,534
She is the same age as you.

481
00:34:01,004 --> 00:34:02,034
What is it?

482
00:34:02,504 --> 00:34:05,974
What's wrong? Did I do something wrong?

483
00:34:06,714 --> 00:34:09,174
Oh, is it because you don't like me?

484
00:34:10,284 --> 00:34:11,484
I...

485
00:34:12,144 --> 00:34:16,314
If you don't want me to, I won't marry your dad.

486
00:34:16,384 --> 00:34:18,424
I will never do anything you hate.

487
00:34:20,654 --> 00:34:22,354
It is not that...

488
00:34:22,424 --> 00:34:24,794
I have a friend named Choi In Ju.

489
00:34:26,124 --> 00:34:29,034
Her parents divorced, and she got a stepmother.

490
00:34:30,304 --> 00:34:34,374
And her stepmother treats In Ju and her own child so differently.

491
00:34:35,904 --> 00:34:38,674
All the delicious food and pretty things,

492
00:34:39,144 --> 00:34:41,074
she only gives them to her own child.

493
00:34:42,274 --> 00:34:44,484
In Ju was so upset that she told her dad,

494
00:34:44,544 --> 00:34:46,314
but her dad said this.

495
00:34:46,654 --> 00:34:50,084
It is human nature to love your own biological child more.

496
00:34:51,484 --> 00:34:53,794
It is only natural, so you have to understand.

497
00:35:03,704 --> 00:35:04,704
Don't cry.

498
00:35:13,474 --> 00:35:15,774
Well, I think it can't be helped even if you treat us differently.

499
00:35:15,774 --> 00:35:17,244
Because it is human nature.

500
00:35:19,114 --> 00:35:21,254
But still, I'm just glad to have a mom.

501
00:35:22,554 --> 00:35:25,024
My mom was sick since I was five,

502
00:35:25,754 --> 00:35:27,994
so I really missed a mother's affection.

503
00:35:37,434 --> 00:35:38,434
Honey.

504
00:35:39,834 --> 00:35:43,344
There are no perpetrators here, okay?

505
00:35:44,374 --> 00:35:46,544
Gyu Rim, you,

506
00:35:46,604 --> 00:35:48,344
Seo Hyun, Mu Jin, and me...

507
00:35:48,414 --> 00:35:49,574
It is nobody's fault.

508
00:35:50,644 --> 00:35:54,254
It is just that the ties we have lived with are so unbelievable,

509
00:35:54,314 --> 00:35:56,784
and the situation is a bit of a mess,

510
00:35:57,784 --> 00:35:59,724
but we still lived our lives to the fullest.

511
00:36:00,424 --> 00:36:04,224
Your only crime is raising Seo Hyun as best as you could.

512
00:36:06,694 --> 00:36:07,694
Honey.

513
00:36:09,794 --> 00:36:12,664
If there is anyone you should be sorry to right now,

514
00:36:15,004 --> 00:36:16,674
it's your biological children.

515
00:36:17,974 --> 00:36:19,174
And especially...

516
00:36:20,214 --> 00:36:21,374
Gyu Rim.

517
00:36:21,874 --> 00:36:23,444
Gyu Rim is the only one.

518
00:37:20,374 --> 00:37:22,574
Did I have you to peel garlic?

519
00:37:22,574 --> 00:37:23,944
What is wrong with you?

520
00:37:24,344 --> 00:37:26,844
Well, do you think Gyu Rim's mom had her just to peel garlic?

521
00:37:29,774 --> 00:37:31,014
Then what about you?

522
00:37:31,014 --> 00:37:33,114
Do you think I went through all that pain...

523
00:37:33,184 --> 00:37:35,654
just to give birth to Han Gyu Rim's human shield?

524
00:37:37,084 --> 00:37:38,484
Then what about Gyu Rim?

525
00:37:38,554 --> 00:37:40,754
Do you think her mom went through all that pain...

526
00:37:40,754 --> 00:37:42,294
to give birth to her just so she could be mistreated...

527
00:37:42,294 --> 00:37:43,924
by a Demon Hag like you?

528
00:37:43,994 --> 00:37:45,224
Demon Hag?

529
00:37:45,564 --> 00:37:48,934
Did you just call your own mother a demon, you punk?

530
00:37:49,064 --> 00:37:50,464
Gyu Rim...

531
00:37:50,804 --> 00:37:53,634
trusts and cares for you like her own mother,

532
00:37:54,134 --> 00:37:57,304
but you are always mistreating her.

533
00:37:57,374 --> 00:37:59,544
How can I not mistreat her?

534
00:37:59,604 --> 00:38:02,614
We are so busy today, but she just skipped work without notice.

535
00:38:03,074 --> 00:38:05,684
What do you mean busy? We don't have one customer.

536
00:38:06,814 --> 00:38:08,614
She said she went somewhere far with Gyeol...

537
00:38:08,684 --> 00:38:10,654
and apologised for not being able to come to work today.

538
00:38:10,724 --> 00:38:12,724
She called you last night, did she not?

539
00:38:12,784 --> 00:38:15,594
She told you in advance, so how is that skipping without notice?

540
00:38:16,094 --> 00:38:19,924
Stop playing around, and why not try taking the bar exam?

541
00:38:20,334 --> 00:38:22,334
Seeing how you defend Han Gyu Rim,

542
00:38:22,394 --> 00:38:26,004
I think you would be a huge success if you went down that path.

543
00:38:26,064 --> 00:38:27,104
No.

544
00:38:27,404 --> 00:38:29,574
I'm just going to help you and play around.

545
00:38:30,034 --> 00:38:31,574
If I become too successful,

546
00:38:31,644 --> 00:38:33,774
you will become too arrogant, so I can't do that.

547
00:38:37,514 --> 00:38:41,284
Your enemy in your past life becomes your child in this life.

548
00:38:41,284 --> 00:38:42,554
Oh, my.

549
00:38:42,614 --> 00:38:45,524
Oh, my poor life, my poor life!

550
00:38:45,584 --> 00:38:47,594
Oh, that old lady, seriously.

551
00:38:50,164 --> 00:38:51,794
Oh, my poor life.

552
00:38:55,964 --> 00:38:58,434
Ma'am!

553
00:38:59,904 --> 00:39:04,344
A golden pig turned into a dragon and ascended to the sky?

554
00:39:07,314 --> 00:39:08,344
This one is for you.

555
00:39:11,044 --> 00:39:13,684
He looks like a rat that ate garbage.

556
00:39:14,314 --> 00:39:16,554
He does not have the face to dream of a dragon.

557
00:39:20,224 --> 00:39:21,354
(500,000 Dollars, Top Prize)

558
00:39:30,034 --> 00:39:31,764
Let us write a contract. A contract, okay?

559
00:39:31,834 --> 00:39:33,774
You will not bother Gyu Rim, and she can stay in her house...

560
00:39:35,834 --> 00:39:37,204
What is it? Did you have a stroke?

561
00:39:37,744 --> 00:39:39,304
Pinch me.

562
00:39:41,374 --> 00:39:43,074
Mom, you pinch me.

563
00:39:43,144 --> 00:39:45,084
- It is real, right? - It is.

564
00:39:47,014 --> 00:39:50,354
- You won 1,000 dollars! - I won 1,000 dollars!

565
00:39:51,454 --> 00:39:53,154
Hey, Mom.

566
00:39:53,224 --> 00:39:58,194
Is this a dream or reality? How could I win the lottery?

567
00:39:58,264 --> 00:40:02,134
Mom, I have never seen a real lottery winner before.

568
00:40:02,194 --> 00:40:03,904
- That dream was right. - What dream?

569
00:40:03,964 --> 00:40:07,504
A pig turned into a dragon and ascended to the sky.

570
00:40:07,574 --> 00:40:11,774
- Oh, my goodness. - Wait, who had the dragon dream?

571
00:40:11,844 --> 00:40:14,144
Gyeol's grandfather had a dragon dream,

572
00:40:14,214 --> 00:40:17,544
bought two lottery tickets, and gave one to me.

573
00:40:18,084 --> 00:40:20,884
Wait, Gyeol's grandfather? You mean Gyu Rim's father?

574
00:40:23,954 --> 00:40:27,254
I think I ran my mouth for nothing.

575
00:40:27,324 --> 00:40:29,854
Oh, we should split it in half then, right?

576
00:40:29,924 --> 00:40:31,094
Wait, wait, that...

577
00:40:31,164 --> 00:40:32,924
Quickly tell him the ticket he gave you won...

578
00:40:32,994 --> 00:40:34,664
He didn't ask for half.

579
00:40:34,734 --> 00:40:37,064
He just asked to let them keep living in their house...

580
00:40:37,134 --> 00:40:38,304
if it wins.

581
00:40:39,604 --> 00:40:40,934
Really?

582
00:40:41,004 --> 00:40:43,804
Awesome. Gyu Rim's father really came through.

583
00:40:43,874 --> 00:40:47,174
Don't say anything for now. I will take care of it,

584
00:40:47,244 --> 00:40:48,844
so don't say a word.

585
00:40:48,914 --> 00:40:51,314
Just keep your mouth shut and go home and relax.

586
00:40:52,084 --> 00:40:54,014
- Watch a TV drama or something. - Okay.

587
00:40:54,084 --> 00:40:55,554
Or rent some comic books to read.

588
00:40:55,614 --> 00:40:58,984
Got it. I will wash up and read comic books before bed.

589
00:41:00,054 --> 00:41:01,054
Okay.

590
00:41:12,004 --> 00:41:13,834
Excuse me, but you two,

591
00:41:13,904 --> 00:41:16,074
why have you been staring at me so intently?

592
00:41:16,534 --> 00:41:18,374
Ever since you walked in,

593
00:41:18,444 --> 00:41:20,914
you have been staring a hole in my face.

594
00:41:21,174 --> 00:41:22,174
Did you know that?

595
00:41:23,214 --> 00:41:24,314
Is there something on my face?

596
00:41:25,414 --> 00:41:26,414
No.

597
00:41:26,944 --> 00:41:28,814
Oh, I'm sorry.

598
00:41:29,454 --> 00:41:33,184
It is just that you look so much like someone I know.

599
00:41:34,094 --> 00:41:37,494
Oh, you also look very familiar to me, Chairman.

600
00:41:37,564 --> 00:41:38,564
I'm sorry.

601
00:41:39,164 --> 00:41:41,334
I don't have a very common face.

602
00:41:41,664 --> 00:41:43,594
Who could I possibly look like?

603
00:41:44,034 --> 00:41:46,264
I do hear that I look like Angelina Jolie sometimes.

604
00:41:46,664 --> 00:41:49,604
- Oh. - Excuse me? Jolie?

605
00:41:51,444 --> 00:41:53,004
Oh, right.

606
00:41:53,914 --> 00:41:57,984
Well, when I was young, I lived in Pohang for a while.

607
00:41:58,744 --> 00:42:00,044
Back then, there was a Korean teacher...

608
00:42:00,114 --> 00:42:02,354
who boarded at our house, and you look just like her.

609
00:42:02,914 --> 00:42:04,384
Her name was Seo Hye Suk.

610
00:42:04,784 --> 00:42:06,324
I actually had a huge crush on Ms. Seo Hye Suk.

611
00:42:06,624 --> 00:42:08,424
Have you ever lived in Pohang by any chance?

612
00:42:11,364 --> 00:42:14,534
What about you, Manager? Who do I look like?

613
00:42:14,594 --> 00:42:15,794
Well, it's just...

614
00:42:15,864 --> 00:42:19,264
You look so much like my friend Shin Jun Hyeong's mother,

615
00:42:19,264 --> 00:42:21,174
who ran a spicy beef soup restaurant.

616
00:42:21,234 --> 00:42:22,474
It really surprised me.

617
00:42:26,044 --> 00:42:28,044
- Are they twins? - I guess it means...

618
00:42:28,044 --> 00:42:29,674
you feel that much closer to me.

619
00:42:29,744 --> 00:42:31,814
- I will take that as a compliment. - Yes.

620
00:42:35,684 --> 00:42:37,224
Oh, Mr. Jo, by the way,

621
00:42:37,854 --> 00:42:40,054
I'm a bit greedy.

622
00:42:40,494 --> 00:42:42,524
There is a competing brand that bothers me so much...

623
00:42:42,594 --> 00:42:44,624
that I can't sleep at night.

624
00:42:44,824 --> 00:42:46,164
Through this collaboration,

625
00:42:46,224 --> 00:42:48,194
I want to completely crush them.

626
00:42:49,134 --> 00:42:50,364
Do you think that is possible, Mr. Jo?

627
00:42:54,034 --> 00:42:56,574
- I will have to try to find out. - Yes, it is possible.

628
00:42:56,634 --> 00:42:58,004
Don't worry and get some good sleep.

629
00:42:58,774 --> 00:43:00,944
How do you know if it is possible without even trying?

630
00:43:01,014 --> 00:43:03,074
At times like this, you just say everything is possible.

631
00:43:03,144 --> 00:43:04,814
- Are you a scammer? - Mr. Jo.

632
00:43:07,384 --> 00:43:08,514
I will have to try to find out.

633
00:43:11,924 --> 00:43:16,694
Wow. I love how honest you are.

634
00:43:17,364 --> 00:43:18,824
Hey,

635
00:43:18,894 --> 00:43:21,594
I really like this guy.

636
00:43:23,594 --> 00:43:24,764
- Mr. Jo. - Yes.

637
00:43:24,834 --> 00:43:27,034
You said you are not married yet, right?

638
00:43:27,474 --> 00:43:29,304
Are you seeing anyone?

639
00:43:29,674 --> 00:43:30,844
No, I'm not.

640
00:43:31,644 --> 00:43:33,504
This is my daughter.

641
00:43:33,874 --> 00:43:35,414
Would you like to go on a date with her?

642
00:43:36,174 --> 00:43:37,184
Chairman.

643
00:43:41,414 --> 00:43:44,424
I appreciate the offer, but no thank you.

644
00:43:44,824 --> 00:43:46,124
We must keep business and personal life separate.

645
00:43:51,394 --> 00:43:52,394
What should we do?

646
00:43:52,464 --> 00:43:54,364
You got rejected before you could even confess.

647
00:44:03,474 --> 00:44:05,344
You can wash up over here, Mother.

648
00:44:12,144 --> 00:44:13,384
Were you successful?

649
00:44:16,814 --> 00:44:19,554
- Do I have a potbelly? - No, not at all.

650
00:44:19,624 --> 00:44:21,724
Oh, Mother, would you like to try this?

651
00:44:21,794 --> 00:44:24,924
A friend from college made it and gave me a few bottles.

652
00:44:24,994 --> 00:44:27,334
He said it is made of completely organic, plant-based ingredients,

653
00:44:27,394 --> 00:44:29,064
and the effects are amazing.

654
00:44:30,094 --> 00:44:32,264
Oh, if it is your college friend,

655
00:44:32,334 --> 00:44:35,804
- he must be a doctor too, right? - Yes, that is right.

656
00:44:35,874 --> 00:44:38,504
Oh, thank you, my daughter-in-law.

657
00:44:39,704 --> 00:44:43,444
- Hey, did you change your perfume? - Smells good, right? Hold on.

658
00:44:43,944 --> 00:44:46,014
Mother, turn around.

659
00:44:47,814 --> 00:44:49,754
Oh my, how luxurious.

660
00:44:50,284 --> 00:44:52,384
It is a new product launched by Chanel.

661
00:44:52,724 --> 00:44:54,124
You can have it, Mother.

662
00:44:54,454 --> 00:44:57,394
It suits you better than me.

663
00:44:57,394 --> 00:45:02,464
Oh my, how is my daughter-in-law so sweet?

664
00:45:02,534 --> 00:45:07,204
Your parents must be busy running their business,

665
00:45:07,274 --> 00:45:10,974
but they really did an amazing job raising their child.

666
00:45:11,404 --> 00:45:14,944
No matter what I give you, it is not a waste, right?

667
00:45:14,944 --> 00:45:16,344
I'm touched.

668
00:45:16,414 --> 00:45:17,784
- Shall we go? - Yes.

669
00:45:23,784 --> 00:45:28,124
Oh my, that woman. "I'm touched."

670
00:45:28,194 --> 00:45:30,664
Oh my, making such a fuss. Give me a break.

671
00:45:30,664 --> 00:45:32,394
Are you the only one with a daughter-in-law?

672
00:45:32,464 --> 00:45:34,094
Are you the only one who has one?

673
00:45:36,434 --> 00:45:39,004
What on earth is Mu Jin doing? Seriously.

674
00:45:45,604 --> 00:45:48,214
- I thought something happened. - Hey,

675
00:45:49,644 --> 00:45:51,614
is there any way to ruin Mu Jin?

676
00:45:51,814 --> 00:45:53,744
I want to ruin him so completely...

677
00:45:53,814 --> 00:45:57,454
and make him fall to his knees and crawl back to me?

678
00:45:59,354 --> 00:46:02,124
Solids have tighter molecular bonds than liquids.

679
00:46:02,194 --> 00:46:03,754
Normally, if you throw a stone like this,

680
00:46:03,824 --> 00:46:05,294
it overcomes the surface tension of the water...

681
00:46:07,294 --> 00:46:10,034
and sinks into the water like this. But look.

682
00:46:10,564 --> 00:46:13,304
If you throw this flat stone at the lowest possible angle,

683
00:46:13,364 --> 00:46:16,074
to maximize the friction area between the water and the stone,

684
00:46:16,134 --> 00:46:17,744
you lower the Theta value as much as possible.

685
00:46:17,804 --> 00:46:18,944
Since it is Theta,

686
00:46:19,474 --> 00:46:21,374
ss it sine Theta? Cosine...

687
00:46:23,614 --> 00:46:25,584
- You didn't understand, did you? - No.

688
00:46:25,914 --> 00:46:27,084
I'm sorry.

689
00:46:27,514 --> 00:46:28,554
First of all,

690
00:46:28,614 --> 00:46:30,884
look for the flattest and smoothest stone like this.

691
00:46:31,054 --> 00:46:34,094
To skip stones, this kind of stone works best.

692
00:46:34,724 --> 00:46:35,724
Throw it.

693
00:46:38,264 --> 00:46:40,634
Try again. Try throwing this one.

694
00:46:40,694 --> 00:46:41,694
Okay.

695
00:46:43,964 --> 00:46:46,464
Look. You take this,

696
00:46:46,534 --> 00:46:49,374
hook your finger on the edge, and hold it like a baseball.

697
00:46:49,434 --> 00:46:50,774
Lower your posture...

698
00:46:51,104 --> 00:46:53,104
so the angle of the stone and the surface of the water...

699
00:46:53,174 --> 00:46:55,074
match at a low angle.

700
00:46:55,144 --> 00:46:57,074
If you throw it from up high, your center of gravity wobbles.

701
00:46:57,144 --> 00:46:58,244
And the angle gets higher.

702
00:46:58,584 --> 00:47:02,114
Sit low and steady, then quickly, throw it.

703
00:47:02,184 --> 00:47:03,914
- Wow! - Do you want to try, Gyeol?

704
00:47:03,984 --> 00:47:04,984
Yes.

705
00:47:09,154 --> 00:47:10,254
Come on.

706
00:47:11,894 --> 00:47:13,194
- Nice. - Wow.

707
00:47:13,264 --> 00:47:16,294
- Gyeol. - Mom, did you see? Did you see?

708
00:47:16,364 --> 00:47:18,364
- Awesome. - Yes, I saw.

709
00:47:18,434 --> 00:47:20,204
Our Gyeol is the absolute best.

710
00:47:20,264 --> 00:47:23,204
I should do it one more time. I have to do it one more time.

711
00:47:24,874 --> 00:47:26,144
She smiled. Han Gyu Rim.

712
00:47:27,474 --> 00:47:28,914
I finally made her smile once.

713
00:47:30,074 --> 00:47:31,084
Let's try it one more time.

714
00:47:35,254 --> 00:47:36,254
What is this?

715
00:47:37,824 --> 00:47:39,054
The money you used to buy Han Gyu Oh.

716
00:47:45,124 --> 00:47:47,224
It is not counterfeit, so you don't have to be suspicious.

717
00:47:48,094 --> 00:47:49,094
What is this about?

718
00:47:50,564 --> 00:47:53,034
If you are asking where I got this money,

719
00:47:53,104 --> 00:47:55,004
I just took out a loan from the bank.

720
00:47:56,104 --> 00:47:58,544
If you are asking why I'm giving it to you,

721
00:47:59,904 --> 00:48:02,644
it is because I'm buying Han Gyu Oh back.

722
00:48:06,014 --> 00:48:07,814
Are you crazy?

723
00:48:08,414 --> 00:48:11,584
- Is Han Gyu Oh some kind of object? - You treat him like one.

724
00:48:11,824 --> 00:48:14,194
That is why you spent all that crazy money and bought him.

725
00:48:15,424 --> 00:48:18,564
Okay. Let's settle this your way.

726
00:48:19,364 --> 00:48:21,734
Money against money.

727
00:48:24,264 --> 00:48:25,534
I thought you said you hated Han Gyu Oh.

728
00:48:26,564 --> 00:48:27,974
You were hiding and avoiding him before,

729
00:48:28,034 --> 00:48:29,374
so what are you trying to do now?

730
00:48:30,874 --> 00:48:32,344
I realised something because of you.

731
00:48:34,244 --> 00:48:36,214
I don't want to give Han Gyu Oh to anyone else.

732
00:48:37,784 --> 00:48:39,014
Especially not to Seo Min Ju.

733
00:48:40,184 --> 00:48:42,884
I don't want to give him up, no matter the cost.

734
00:48:48,654 --> 00:48:49,654
I'm not selling him.

735
00:48:50,864 --> 00:48:52,424
I would not sell Han Gyu Oh to you even if I died.

736
00:48:54,664 --> 00:48:56,194
You took the money, so it is over.

737
00:49:00,164 --> 00:49:01,774
Why you... Hey!

738
00:49:03,034 --> 00:49:04,944
(Do not wake me unless the house is on fire.)

739
00:49:14,114 --> 00:49:16,584
"Don't wake me unless the house is on fire."

740
00:49:22,754 --> 00:49:24,794
Your ugly face just got even uglier.

741
00:49:57,964 --> 00:49:59,094
What time is it?

742
00:49:59,964 --> 00:50:01,694
Why does a jobless person need to know the time?

743
00:50:02,334 --> 00:50:03,334
Go back to sleep.

744
00:50:04,964 --> 00:50:05,964
Sleep, sleep tight.

745
00:50:07,674 --> 00:50:10,404
Hush, hush, hush...

746
00:50:12,074 --> 00:50:13,074
Sleep, sleep, sleep...

747
00:50:27,424 --> 00:50:28,694
What could the password be?

748
00:50:30,394 --> 00:50:31,594
Birthdays, anniversaries.

749
00:50:31,664 --> 00:50:33,394
He hates things like that more than you would think.

750
00:50:34,734 --> 00:50:36,634
It's probably something really simple.

751
00:50:38,564 --> 00:50:41,604
Zero, zero, zero, zero, zero. No. One, two, three, four, five, six.

752
00:50:41,674 --> 00:50:42,674
No, that is not it.

753
00:50:45,744 --> 00:50:48,374
Five, six, seven, eight, nine, zero. It is highly unlikely, but...

754
00:50:52,514 --> 00:50:53,644
Five, six, seven, eight, nine, zero?

755
00:50:55,054 --> 00:50:57,514
How could a guy with such a complicated life have a password...

756
00:50:57,584 --> 00:50:58,584
that's 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 0?

757
00:51:20,374 --> 00:51:22,674
- What? - Shut it or bugs will fly in.

758
00:51:24,884 --> 00:51:26,344
So you are saying...

759
00:51:26,414 --> 00:51:28,954
Gyu Oh is like one of those guys in the movies...

760
00:51:29,014 --> 00:51:30,684
who seduces women and extorts their money...

761
00:51:30,754 --> 00:51:31,954
That is not what is important right now.

762
00:51:32,024 --> 00:51:33,784
How is that not important?

763
00:51:34,924 --> 00:51:36,194
Gyu Oh is...

764
00:51:36,794 --> 00:51:39,294
Gyu Oh is a host bar escort, how is that...

765
00:51:39,294 --> 00:51:40,394
Hey, speak louder.

766
00:51:41,064 --> 00:51:43,334
So Gyu Oh and the rest of the family can hear you.

767
00:51:43,394 --> 00:51:45,464
So everyone in the neighbourhood knows.

768
00:51:49,004 --> 00:51:52,104
I'm just as angry as you are, upset, and going crazy,

769
00:51:52,504 --> 00:51:54,374
and I want to just kill Gyu Oh.

770
00:51:55,114 --> 00:51:56,674
I feel the exact same way,

771
00:51:57,044 --> 00:51:58,344
but he had his reasons.

772
00:51:59,584 --> 00:52:00,714
What reasons?

773
00:52:01,184 --> 00:52:02,984
How could there be a reason for such crazy behaviour?

774
00:52:04,624 --> 00:52:06,054
Of all people,

775
00:52:06,484 --> 00:52:08,054
Gyu Oh...

776
00:52:08,124 --> 00:52:10,454
How could he do something like this?

777
00:52:10,994 --> 00:52:12,364
If Gyu Rim finds out,

778
00:52:12,724 --> 00:52:15,234
- Hey, if Gyu Rim finds out... - He is dead.

779
00:52:16,434 --> 00:52:17,704
Gyu Rim will kill him instantly.

780
00:52:20,404 --> 00:52:22,334
That is why I'm trying to discuss this with you.

781
00:52:22,404 --> 00:52:23,834
Because you are smarter than me.

782
00:52:39,884 --> 00:52:42,894
(Do not wake me unless the house is on fire.)

783
00:52:47,224 --> 00:52:49,934
(Do not wake me unless the house is on fire.)

784
00:53:14,184 --> 00:53:15,224
(Medical bill receipt)

785
00:53:15,294 --> 00:53:17,864
I took a picture with my phone. The messages on Gyu Oh's phone.

786
00:53:19,594 --> 00:53:20,594
Eight years ago,

787
00:53:20,664 --> 00:53:22,364
he got into a fight with a guy named Son Ji Yeol...

788
00:53:22,694 --> 00:53:23,994
while trying to save his friend.

789
00:53:24,194 --> 00:53:26,434
But that guy got hit by him and suffered a severe head injury.

790
00:53:40,884 --> 00:53:43,254
Since then, he has been paying for that guy's surgeries,

791
00:53:43,314 --> 00:53:45,184
hospital bills, and medical expenses.

792
00:53:46,454 --> 00:53:48,294
He didn't have the money, so he even took out private loans.

793
00:53:49,624 --> 00:53:51,924
He had no choice but to do this to pay off those loans.

794
00:54:00,004 --> 00:54:01,704
You know he dropped out of high school.

795
00:54:01,774 --> 00:54:02,834
With only middle school, what could he do...

796
00:54:02,904 --> 00:54:04,334
to earn that kind of massive money?

797
00:54:06,674 --> 00:54:09,314
The guy who bullied the weak person in the first place was the bad one.

798
00:54:09,574 --> 00:54:11,684
He was just trying to save his friend,

799
00:54:11,744 --> 00:54:14,014
so Gyu Oh does not have to take all the responsibility.

800
00:54:14,144 --> 00:54:15,954
The guy he hit was an orphan.

801
00:54:16,914 --> 00:54:18,224
He had no parents and no siblings.

802
00:54:19,024 --> 00:54:20,284
No,

803
00:54:20,354 --> 00:54:21,954
but still, why is he being such a pushover...

804
00:54:22,024 --> 00:54:23,324
and doing this until now?

805
00:54:23,954 --> 00:54:26,064
I saw his texts earlier, and until recently,

806
00:54:26,124 --> 00:54:28,464
he transferred a ton of money to that guy's wife.

807
00:54:28,934 --> 00:54:30,894
Did Gyu Oh hit his head or something?

808
00:54:30,964 --> 00:54:32,264
Is he out of his mind?

809
00:54:33,704 --> 00:54:34,974
Where are you going?

810
00:54:35,034 --> 00:54:39,404
To tell Gyu Oh he's a complete idiot and that he needs to snap out of it.

811
00:54:39,474 --> 00:54:40,904
If he finds out you know his secret,

812
00:54:40,974 --> 00:54:43,914
- he's going to dig a hole and hide. - So what?

813
00:54:43,974 --> 00:54:45,814
What do you want me to do?

814
00:54:47,044 --> 00:54:48,614
You shouldn't have told me then.

815
00:54:48,684 --> 00:54:50,414
You should've kept it a secret till the end.

816
00:54:51,184 --> 00:54:55,354
I'm so upset. I'm so incredibly upset right now.

817
00:55:00,424 --> 00:55:02,564
But you're my older sister by one minute.

818
00:55:02,634 --> 00:55:04,364
I thought you'd have the answer.

819
00:55:06,064 --> 00:55:07,904
It was too hard to keep it to myself.

820
00:55:07,974 --> 00:55:09,874
I felt like I was going to explode.

821
00:55:16,614 --> 00:55:17,884
I'm sorry.

822
00:55:18,444 --> 00:55:19,884
I should've just worried about it alone.

823
00:55:20,084 --> 00:55:21,814
- I'm so upset. - I'm sorry.

824
00:55:23,654 --> 00:55:25,754
What are we going to do about him?

825
00:55:29,624 --> 00:55:32,624
(Pharmacy)

826
00:55:38,664 --> 00:55:39,704
Darn it.

827
00:55:43,434 --> 00:55:45,904
You must have 13 missed calls from me.

828
00:55:46,344 --> 00:55:47,374
Why aren't you calling me back?

829
00:55:49,414 --> 00:55:50,644
Because I don't want to.

830
00:55:51,484 --> 00:55:53,744
- Hey! - Don't call me for a while.

831
00:55:55,054 --> 00:55:56,414
Did Kwon Hee Na call you?

832
00:55:58,284 --> 00:56:01,194
That crazy Kwon Hee Na bought you back from me.

833
00:56:01,594 --> 00:56:02,954
Did that girl not say anything?

834
00:56:15,704 --> 00:56:17,434
What's wrong? Do you have an eye infection?

835
00:56:18,574 --> 00:56:20,744
I cursed you to get a foot disease and collapse,

836
00:56:21,104 --> 00:56:22,274
but you only got an eye infection?

837
00:56:23,314 --> 00:56:24,744
I heard you gave Seo Min Ju money.

838
00:56:25,214 --> 00:56:26,314
And you even took out a loan.

839
00:56:27,584 --> 00:56:30,084
She even told you about the loan?

840
00:56:30,854 --> 00:56:32,454
Well, yes.

841
00:56:32,524 --> 00:56:34,154
Must be nice to have so much money.

842
00:56:34,454 --> 00:56:36,394
But that's her mom's money, not hers.

843
00:56:37,694 --> 00:56:38,864
Why did you do it?

844
00:56:39,424 --> 00:56:40,424
None of your business.

845
00:56:41,394 --> 00:56:42,564
Do you like me?

846
00:56:43,234 --> 00:56:44,264
Are you on drugs?

847
00:56:44,864 --> 00:56:47,004
Why would I like a piece of trash like you?

848
00:56:49,574 --> 00:56:50,574
Exactly.

849
00:56:53,574 --> 00:56:56,674
Get your money back. I'm not even worth that much.

850
00:56:57,944 --> 00:56:59,284
I wanted to see you to tell you that.

851
00:57:03,014 --> 00:57:05,054
I'll be the judge of whether you're worth it or not.

852
00:57:09,954 --> 00:57:11,464
Do you have money to burn?

853
00:57:12,024 --> 00:57:15,094
How much do you even make a month? That's a lot of money for you.

854
00:57:16,094 --> 00:57:17,464
Get your money back right now.

855
00:57:18,164 --> 00:57:20,564
I'm spending my own money. What do you care?

856
00:57:20,964 --> 00:57:22,004
You're just an object.

857
00:57:25,404 --> 00:57:27,244
If you can be bought and sold, aren't you an object?

858
00:57:28,314 --> 00:57:30,674
You are an object, Han Gyu Oh.

859
00:57:32,314 --> 00:57:34,244
When I get sick and tired of you,

860
00:57:34,854 --> 00:57:37,514
you're a worthless object I can throw away anytime.

861
00:57:46,224 --> 00:57:47,324
I'll say this one last time.

862
00:57:48,534 --> 00:57:49,794
Get your money back.

863
00:57:51,094 --> 00:57:52,104
No.

864
00:57:55,004 --> 00:57:56,634
I'm going to tell your parents...

865
00:57:56,874 --> 00:57:58,404
that their daughter is seeing a piece of trash...

866
00:57:58,474 --> 00:58:00,044
and ruining her life,

867
00:58:00,344 --> 00:58:02,974
- so they need to come stop you. - Fine, tell them.

868
00:58:03,144 --> 00:58:05,214
How would you even know where my parents are?

869
00:58:05,284 --> 00:58:06,784
If I ask Su Nam,

870
00:58:06,844 --> 00:58:08,484
she will at least give me their phone numbers.

871
00:58:08,554 --> 00:58:11,384
- Hey. That is playing dirty. - I do what I say I will do.

872
00:58:11,454 --> 00:58:12,624
Get it back by today.

873
00:58:15,554 --> 00:58:16,854
Then don't see Seo Min Ju.

874
00:58:18,564 --> 00:58:20,564
You're mine. I'm the one who will like you.

875
00:58:26,104 --> 00:58:27,334
I'll be the only one who likes you.

876
00:58:32,604 --> 00:58:34,344
If you even think about seeing Seo Min Ju,

877
00:58:34,404 --> 00:58:36,074
you and I will both die.

878
00:59:00,604 --> 00:59:01,834
- Mister. - Yes?

879
00:59:01,834 --> 00:59:05,344
We should run away again next time to somewhere nobody knows.

880
00:59:05,404 --> 00:59:07,744
- Gyeol. - Yes, we should do that.

881
00:59:32,204 --> 00:59:33,204
Here.

882
00:59:37,674 --> 00:59:38,674
Go on in.

883
00:59:39,844 --> 00:59:41,414
Go inside. See you later.

884
00:59:41,474 --> 00:59:44,644
- Okay, goodbye. Thank you. - Yes.

885
00:59:46,144 --> 00:59:47,844
Gyeol, do you want to go inside first?

886
00:59:47,914 --> 00:59:49,854
I'll talk to him for a bit and then go in.

887
00:59:49,914 --> 00:59:50,984
Okay, I understand.

888
00:59:57,024 --> 00:59:58,764
(500,000 Dollars, Top Prize)

889
01:00:06,734 --> 01:00:07,764
Seriously.

890
01:00:09,434 --> 01:00:12,804
The dragon was ascending to the sky but took a wrong turn.

891
01:00:12,874 --> 01:00:15,744
This is not even a joke. What is this?

892
01:00:15,814 --> 01:00:17,874
Man, seriously, if I...

893
01:00:17,944 --> 01:00:19,914
ever buy a lottery ticket again,

894
01:00:19,984 --> 01:00:22,814
- I will be Gyeol's grandson. Darn.. - Grandpa.

895
01:00:22,884 --> 01:00:23,884
Don't call me.

896
01:00:28,024 --> 01:00:29,624
I'm sorry for worrying you.

897
01:00:31,054 --> 01:00:32,064
Hey.

898
01:00:33,324 --> 01:00:35,794
Do you see these wrinkles here?

899
01:00:35,864 --> 01:00:37,994
I got all of these because of you.

900
01:00:38,364 --> 01:00:40,264
Because you ran away from home and stressed me out.

901
01:00:40,804 --> 01:00:43,334
I'm sorry. I will never do it again.

902
01:00:44,474 --> 01:00:46,944
Whatever, forget it. I'm completely upset.

903
01:00:47,244 --> 01:00:49,114
Please don't hate me too much.

904
01:00:52,884 --> 01:00:53,884
Hey.

905
01:00:55,084 --> 01:00:57,614
Put yourself in my shoes.

906
01:00:57,714 --> 01:00:59,854
Would you not hate yourself if you were me?

907
01:01:00,124 --> 01:01:01,654
The guy who makes his child cry...

908
01:01:04,394 --> 01:01:05,664
Man.

909
01:01:06,324 --> 01:01:07,524
Whatever. Anyway,

910
01:01:08,164 --> 01:01:11,804
at least you should not make your mom cry. Okay?

911
01:01:11,864 --> 01:01:13,604
Hey, the guys who made your mom cry are currently...

912
01:01:13,664 --> 01:01:15,234
taking numbers and waiting in line.

913
01:01:15,774 --> 01:01:16,834
Okay.

914
01:01:23,614 --> 01:01:24,674
Come here.

915
01:01:30,354 --> 01:01:31,384
So now...

916
01:01:32,484 --> 01:01:34,454
you don't hate me anymore?

917
01:01:36,124 --> 01:01:38,154
I will give you one more chance even if I hate you.

918
01:01:56,914 --> 01:01:58,414
Thanks to you, Mu Jin,

919
01:01:59,544 --> 01:02:01,614
I had a very, very happy dream.

920
01:02:04,414 --> 01:02:06,524
I told everyone not to wake me up,

921
01:02:06,584 --> 01:02:09,994
and that I would not leave anyone alone if they did.

922
01:02:12,124 --> 01:02:14,064
I had my claws out the whole time.

923
01:02:19,864 --> 01:02:21,334
We should stop here.

924
01:02:26,074 --> 01:02:27,074
Gyu Rim.

925
01:02:29,674 --> 01:02:31,544
Even if they gave me the world,

926
01:02:32,784 --> 01:02:35,254
I wouldn't trade them...

927
01:02:37,714 --> 01:02:39,024
for yesterday and today.

928
01:02:47,964 --> 01:02:49,194
Was my heart...

929
01:02:50,894 --> 01:02:52,164
not enough?

930
01:02:55,534 --> 01:02:57,134
I was happy enough.

931
01:02:59,704 --> 01:03:01,374
I was overwhelmingly thankful.

932
01:03:04,544 --> 01:03:05,644
And I was so happy...

933
01:03:07,484 --> 01:03:08,784
that it brought me to tears.

934
01:03:11,084 --> 01:03:12,254
But why?

935
01:03:14,424 --> 01:03:16,024
If we get back together...

936
01:03:18,024 --> 01:03:19,794
someone else will...

937
01:03:19,864 --> 01:03:21,794
get hurt and wounded again.

938
01:03:23,964 --> 01:03:25,764
Me, you,

939
01:03:27,064 --> 01:03:28,504
and someone else too.

940
01:03:30,074 --> 01:03:31,874
I don't want anyone getting hurt.

941
01:03:36,114 --> 01:03:37,914
They say you shouldn't take...

942
01:03:39,944 --> 01:03:41,214
a path with an obvious end.

943
01:03:44,254 --> 01:03:46,324
If I confused you and messed with your feelings,

944
01:03:47,584 --> 01:03:50,824
knowing I couldn't even make it to the end...

945
01:03:53,064 --> 01:03:55,464
and being too much of a coward to try,

946
01:03:57,334 --> 01:03:58,504
then for that,

947
01:04:00,904 --> 01:04:02,274
I'm so, so sorry.

948
01:04:26,624 --> 01:04:28,294
I need to see how this ends, Gyu Rim.

949
01:04:35,474 --> 01:04:37,804
Even if I get hurt, you get hurt,

950
01:04:38,404 --> 01:04:40,144
and someone else gets hurt,

951
01:04:41,374 --> 01:04:42,674
I just have to see...

952
01:04:43,744 --> 01:04:46,484
what happens to us in the end.

953
01:04:52,524 --> 01:04:53,654
I'm sorry, Gyu Rim.

954
01:05:25,184 --> 01:05:27,024
(Love on the Menu)

955
01:05:27,084 --> 01:05:29,754
- You definitely look familiar. - It has been a while, sir.

956
01:05:29,824 --> 01:05:32,624
Sir? Are you seeing my Gyu Rim again or something?

957
01:05:32,624 --> 01:05:34,964
How much do you know about my brother?

958
01:05:34,964 --> 01:05:38,134
How much do I need to know? I don't care about his past.

959
01:05:38,194 --> 01:05:39,604
What is all this?

960
01:05:39,664 --> 01:05:43,774
This lunch box looks exactly like the ones my mom used to pack for me.

961
01:05:43,834 --> 01:05:46,574
Take it back. I take back telling you to go to Han Gyu Rim.

962
01:05:46,644 --> 01:05:47,974
We can't do this. Really.

963
01:05:48,044 --> 01:05:51,274
I'm saying you are the one for me. I'm saying I can't live without you.

964
01:05:51,344 --> 01:05:52,384
I'm a single mother.

965
01:05:52,444 --> 01:05:54,244
That will be solved once you marry me.

